@startuml bridge_ilogger_class
title ILogger + ILoggerProvider — Most w MEL

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

interface ILogger {
  + Log(level, eventId, state, ex, formatter)
  + IsEnabled(level) : bool
  + BeginScope(state) : IDisposable
}

interface ILoggerProvider {
  + CreateLogger(categoryName) : ILogger
  + Dispose()
}

class LoggerFactory {
  - _providers : ILoggerProvider[]
  + CreateLogger(categoryName) : ILogger
  + AddProvider(provider)
}

class Logger {
  - _providers : ILoggerProvider[]
  + Log(...)
}

class ConsoleLoggerProvider {
  + CreateLogger(categoryName) : ILogger
}

class SerilogLoggerProvider {
  + CreateLogger(categoryName) : ILogger
}

class InMemoryLoggerProvider {
  + Entries : List<string>
  + CreateLogger(categoryName) : ILogger
}

ILogger <|.. Logger
ILoggerProvider <|.. ConsoleLoggerProvider
ILoggerProvider <|.. SerilogLoggerProvider
ILoggerProvider <|.. InMemoryLoggerProvider

LoggerFactory --> Logger : tworzy
LoggerFactory o--> ILoggerProvider : agreguje

note right of ILogger
  Abstrakcja (Most)
  Kod aplikacji zalezy
  tylko od ILogger
end note

note right of ILoggerProvider
  Implementor (Most)
  Kazdy provider pisze
  do innego celu
end note

@enduml
